{"ticker":"INTU","updated":"2026-11-27T23:00:55Z","profile":{"longName":"Intuit Inc.","shortName":"Intuit Inc.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Application","country":"United States","website":"https://www.intuit.com","fullTimeEmployees":18600,"marketCap":71647854592,"trailingPE":15.477519,"forwardPE":10.521754,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.269054,"pegRatio":0.85,"targetMeanPrice":356.83344,"targetHighPrice":670.0,"targetLowPrice":270.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":32,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.121,"earningsGrowth":0.629,"grossMargins":0.80627,"operatingMargins":0.29758,"profitMargins":0.21969,"totalRevenue":21916999680,"beta":0.921,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":681.2,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":252.84,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.03},"summary":"Intuit Inc. provides financial management, payments and capital, compliance, and marketing products and services in the United States. The company operates in two segments: Global Business Solutions and Consumer. Its Global Business Solutions segment provides QuickBooks services, which include financial and business management online services, desktop software, payroll solutions, time tracking, merchant payment processing and bill pay solutions, checking accounts, and financing services for small and mid-market businesses; and Mailchimp, a marketing automation and customer relationship management. The Consumer segment provides TurboTax, a do-it-yourself and assisted income tax preparation products and services; Credit Karma, a personal finance solution that provides recommendations for credit card, home, auto, and personal loan, and insurance products; online savings and checking accounts; and access to its credit scores and reports, credit and identity monitoring, credit report dispute, credit building tools, debt pay-down assistance, credit card rewards optimization, and connected account capabilities. This segment also offers ProTax offerings which include Lacerte, ProSeries, and ProFile desktop tax-preparation software products; and ProConnect Tax Online, electronic tax filing service, and bank products and related services. It sells products and services through direct sal","summary_zh":"Intuit Inc. 在美國提供財務管理、支付和資本、合規性以及行銷產品和服務。該公司分為兩個部門：全球商業解決方案部門和消費者部門。其全球商業解決方案部門提供QuickBooks服務，其中包括財務和商業管理線上服務、桌面軟體、薪資解決方案、時間追蹤、商家支付處理和帳單支付解決方案、支票帳戶以及針對中小型企業的融資服務； Mailchimp，一種行銷自動化和客戶關係管理。消費者部門提供 TurboTax，一種自助和輔助所得稅準備產品和服務； Credit Karma，一種個人理財解決方案，為信用卡、房屋、汽車、個人貸款以及保險產品提供建議；線上儲蓄和支票帳戶；並存取其信用評分和報告、信用和身分監控、信用報告爭議、信用建設工具、債務償還援助、信用卡功能優化和債務關聯帳戶。該部門還提供 ProTax 產品，包括 Lacerte、ProSeries 和 ProFile 桌上型報稅軟體產品； ProConnect Tax Online、電子報稅服務以及銀行產品和相關服務。它透過直接銷售的方式銷售產品和服務","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"軟體 - 應用程式","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-29","o":700.05,"h":703.96,"l":691.47,"c":694.69,"v":1816500},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":697.02,"h":702.12,"l":680.12,"c":682.91,"v":2378600},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":679.84,"h":686.19,"l":674.08,"c":679.5,"v":2151600},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":676.77,"h":682.95,"l":668.36,"c":681.86,"v":2289100},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":677.06,"h":688.37,"l":677.06,"c":679.94,"v":1293900},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":667.02,"h":676.17,"l":658.33,"c":670.09,"v":2538400},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":670.92,"h":671.73,"l":654.34,"c":657.99,"v":1597800},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":659.57,"h":664.0,"l":655.23,"c":657.8,"v":1699800},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":655.0,"h":658.0,"l":643.16,"c":644.92,"v":1698300},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":645.4,"h":653.18,"l":641.23,"c":641.79,"v":3059300},{"t":"2025-10-13","o":643.2,"h":656.47,"l":642.64,"c":655.68,"v":1344900},{"t":"2025-10-14","o":645.82,"h":660.71,"l":644.45,"c":657.16,"v":1243700},{"t":"2025-10-15","o":657.1,"h":657.42,"l":647.76,"c":652.69,"v":1693000},{"t":"2025-10-16","o":659.21,"h":659.4,"l":642.74,"c":646.99,"v":1248000},{"t":"2025-10-17","o":647.57,"h":662.27,"l":646.84,"c":661.39,"v":1812900},{"t":"2025-10-20","o":663.28,"h":668.86,"l":658.49,"c":664.77,"v":1205800},{"t":"2025-10-21","o":665.67,"h":676.88,"l":661.0,"c":675.04,"v":1201600